{"id":"cuestio_n","lemma":"cuestión","pos":"noun","rank":829,"glosses":["matter, question, issue","thing"],"ipa":"/kwesˈtjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cuestiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/94/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cuesti%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Era cuestión de dinero.","en":"It was about money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448410","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"Eso es cuestión aparte.","en":"That's another issue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454219","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"separately, apart"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"Los estudiantes preguntaron cuestiones una tras otra.","en":"The students asked questions one after another.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703661","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"student","l":"estudiante"},{"g":"to ask","l":"preguntar"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"after"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"}]},{"text":"Eso está fuera de cuestión.","en":"It's out of the question.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937693","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"away from"]]},{"text":"Todo es cuestión del momento.","en":"It's all about the timing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611337","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"moment, instant"}]}]}